  "id": "vanity",
  "title": "VANITY — the Vanity Role-Playing Game",
  "description": "A generic d6 RPG where ego is a resource and the universe keeps score. Pool = Attribute + Knack + situation; 5–6 = a Success; fail with two 1s = a Stumble that banks a Bane of Karma (Draft 13). No hit points — Grit. Vanity, Karma and Glory drive play. Includes the full Draft 13 rulebook, all spells and gear, the starter bestiary, five ready-to-play characters and the one-shot adventure The Vain Crown.",
